                                                "sense_id": "ec28d2dc-6fad-3524-a05a-a50bf21e123c",
                                                "text": "The building was erected in two years, at the parochial expence, on the foundation of the former one, which was irreparably damaged by the hurricane of Auguſt, 1712."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a40ddfd-772e-45f9-9c93-3c3e070a0b2b",
                                                "sense_id": "ec28d2dc-6fad-3524-a05a-a50bf21e123c",
                                                "text": "He […] came up to the English admiral and gave him a broadside, with which he killed many of his men and damaged the ship."
